# The image build reads this folder through its own build context ("media" in
# compose.yml). Only the files the manifests list are sent to the builder, so any other
# downloads left here (the HTTP Server installer, documentation, Windows-only installers)
# cost nothing. Keep these lines in step with the *.sha256 manifests;
# build/check-media.sh warns when they drift.
*
!*.sha256

